notes.notes:
1. The evil spirit chasing you has been slowed down. You now have the ability to escape much more easily;
2. Added a sound effect emitted by the spirit to notify you of its approach;
3. Added visual clues in the starting location:
- Totems to collect;
- Avoid the enemy;
- Lightning tells you where to look for the path to the next totem;
- To pick up a code from a safe, you need to find a clue placed near the same safe. The hint makes it clear what you need to count and in what sequence;
- Observation window for the ritual area. The ritual will be ready when the required number of totems is collected.
